{"version":1,"content":"<p>內地健身博主「東東小魔王」近日在山西懸空寺手拉橫樑做引體上升，相關影片引來大量批評。</p><p>懸空寺景區工作人員今天（12日）表示，相關行為「肯定不被允許」，目前正在核實情況，如果有必要會報警。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T10:19:35.453859+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":93,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T09:46:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T17:37:41.887173+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T10:17:40.946943+00:00","content_hash":"810275b516a0c43e97bcbc7e9831a1ae179a16d281ae40ba2966cbf4bb12a962","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}